WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:05.680
Lately, lots of people have been fraudulently downloading television programs over the internet.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:12.650
Without the rights-holder's permission, distribution via the internet or bootlegs is prohibited by law!

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.780
So, don't do it!

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.010
Please take care!

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.250
The Research Department's mistake?

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.340
You thought I wouldn't notice?

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.530
When we took on the assignment of data collection,

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.300
those "mistakes" would have been made obvious!

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.610
There's nothing else to say. Mistakes happen.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:39.260
You can't just let this slide!

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.170
Let me ask you this.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:46.790
Since you noticed problems right away, why was Plug injured?

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.330
She wasn't authorized to use the suit...

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.750
Let alone charge with it.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:58.070
You seriously underestimated the consequences of the situation.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:03.540
Even though it's a prototype, the fact that the Research Department's test product was ruined...

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.990
...is a great loss for the company.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:09.050
But... that's...

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:15.780
I've kept all of this hidden and even provided worker's compensation, so what's the problem?

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.930
What now?

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.910
Please accept my apologies.

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:32.540
You're dismissed.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:33.680
Yes.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:35.130
If you'll excuse me.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.620
There was no choice, Alesta.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:22.970
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:22.970
Miracles are right beside reality

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.060
Kanarazu aru

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.060
They're there for sure

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:37.410
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:37.410
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:43.320
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:43.320
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:49.260
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:49.260
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:55.440
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:55.440
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.850
Hitori janai

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.850
You're not alone

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:03.120
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:03.120
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:09.060
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:09.060
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:15.000
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:15.000
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:20.980
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:20.980
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:26.850
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:26.850
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:34.640
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:34.640
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.210
Hey there, Alesta!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.290
You're in a surprisingly good mood.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.090
On the outside, yeah, but...

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.170
If it weren't for the painkillers,
I would have gone crazy by now.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.130
Did everything go smoothly?

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:07.010
Yeah. Apparently my vitals are stable now, so there's nothing much to worry about.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:09.520
All thanks to your freaky constitution, huh?

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.600
That's right!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.890
No, it's not!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.400
Will you continue to work?

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.480
You're not quitting on me, are you?

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.690
Course not. I'm built to last.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:26.620
But... I wish I could say the same for my crispy arms.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.830
Some serious cell regeneration is needed.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:35.380
If they're regenerated too quickly,
the risk of DNA mutation increases.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:36.960
So I'm stuck here for now.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:37.790
I see.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:44.180
That's why... during my time here,
I'm leaving my area of jurisdiction to you, Alesta.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.850
That's why I told you not to charge him!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.680
Alright, then.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:59.110
All of this is because I was a wimp and gave in to your blackmail,

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.730
so I am responsible as well.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:06.870
Don't say that. You're not to blame, Alesta.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.450
Got that right! You're the one that acted like a hero and got us into this mess!

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.500
Don't add insults to my injuries!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.960
So maybe taking a secret picture was wrong...

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:24.050
Sign: Plug Cryostat

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:24.050
...but I never expected it to be blackmail material.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.130
Is there a reason to it?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.050
It's just an embarrassing picture!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.050
Stop giving excuses and just delete it!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:34.770
No problem.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:40.940
But will you accept my final request?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.990
Maid in Alesta!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.990
Maid in Alesta!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.500
Welcome!

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.500
Perfect!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.460
They're so cute!

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.800
This is very embarrassing.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.420
The chest size is too big for me.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.970
That's the beauty of it!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:14.020
The outfit is trying to emphasize something she doesn't have...

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.680
Exactly right, Manager!

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.810
Just talking to myself.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.190
Then, one more time.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.520
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.480
Welcome!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.280
One more time!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.360
Welcome!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:34.950
I asked them to work here to compensate for that incident, but...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.160
<i>Was that such a good idea?</i>

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.170
<i>Depression level around F, huh?</i>

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.710
<i>Depression level E.</i>

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:46.920
<i>That girl over there is a C.</i>

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.090
<i>This customer is a D, I think?</i>

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.140
<i>Wait.</i>

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.600
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.140
<i>I'm not a Charging Lady.</i>

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.770
What kind of outfit is this?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.230
Don't you know, Maid?

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:07.740
No idea.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.280
Don't worry about it.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:12.740
Y-Yeah... but...

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.780
How should I put this...

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:18.830
Why am I suddenly feeling more submissive than usual?

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.710
<i>What a nice expression...</i>

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.710
Now then, what duties should I give you?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:24.920
Wait a second!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:30.170
This is really the last request, right? I'm not being blackmailed forever.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.260
Don't worry, I'll delete all the data.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.640
<i>But... she's far cuter than I imagined!</i>

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.600
<i>What sort of outfit will I have her try on next time?</i>

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.560
<i>How mesmerizing!</i>

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.570
<i>Oh yeah! How about a class president?</i>

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.110
<i>She'd look perfect in that.</i>

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.530
So true!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.580
Well, first off, please fetch me this week's manga magazines.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.370
D-Dressed like this?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.660
You don't want to?

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.130
Fine, I get the picture...

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.460
From the parallel world!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.760
You know I can't do that!

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:13.340
No problem! That maid outfit is made from anti-stealth material!

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.220
Anti-stealth?

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.930
It's easy to understand with some explanation!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.600
Originally, when the Charging Ladies from Life Core...

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.980
...traveled to the parallel world...

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.400
...they were not easily seen, nor heard.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.150
Just like this.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.780
And to parallel world's humans, they exist in a state of complete invisibility with the stealth system on.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.740
They are also totally untouchable.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.490
Thus the anti-stealth material was invented!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.490
Anti-Stealth Material

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.240
With this...

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:42.660
...they can be seen, heard and touched!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.000
It's a dream-like new material!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.000
That's not the problem...

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.510
So you really don't want to?

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:04.850
What is she? Is there a TV shoot going on?

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.900
Mom, there's a weird looking lady.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.980
Don't stare!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.030
Here they are!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:20.160
Hooray! Wait...

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:24.080
Why didn't you get a copy of "My Dear Sister"?!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.620
As if I know your weird taste in reading material!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.590
No problem.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.300
I know of a great place to find one!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.600
Why did I agree to come here?

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:51.110
If I were to be seen by Sentou at this kind of place...

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.570
Aah~

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.570
Master!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.530
If I was seen...

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:04.620
P-Please help yourself, Master!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.370
Play ball!

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:12.840
Sentou... more...

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:17.680
I'll make you feel good, meow,
so let's go beyond the distance, meow!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.720
What was I thinking?! How lewd!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.270
Let's see now...

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.110
Manga: My Dear Sister

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.070
Here it is.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:45.700
Hurry up, show more, more!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.920
A mini-skirted maid with striped panties, moé!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.130
Please look this way!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:55.590
Everyone, the end of the line is over here...

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:02.050
No!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.310
What was that?! What the hell was that?!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.310
It's best that you don't know.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:10.770
Anyway, I'm hungry. How about stir-fried vegetables?

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.610
Flip!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.070
Wow, you're awesome, Iono!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.820
I'm sure my brother will be happy, too.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:24.030
But does Senny like omelets?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.290
Maybe he started to?

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:26.700
He does!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.750
Plus, they're healthy and they go well with anything.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.170
And they were on sale last week and the week before!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.630
What?! That's why?!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.130
I... won't lose!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:40.010
My, my you're one to talk.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.590
What a conceited girl.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.050
I won't lose...

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:49.060
But are you sure you should be acting so defiant to me?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:52.270
You realize I know your secret, right?

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:58.530
That sacred, precious secret that you can't tell anyone.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:01.490
Don't! You can't reveal that, anything but that!

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.240
Well, maybe I won't...

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.200
I beg you...

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.950
So, you're asking me to keep it a secret, huh?

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.410
Then...

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.170
What are you doing to Milly?!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.590
Cow! Demon boobs! Stuffed G-cup!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.930
Eat dirt, you.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:36.360
That's it, more! Sing for more, girlie!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:39.230
Howl like a bitch, like a little bitch!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.150
Scream!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.700
Squeal!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.280
Cry!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.990
Hey, Mistress Silica...

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:51.540
If you keep whipping her like that, people will seriously creep out...

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:57.250
Brother, it's done.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.000
Alright.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.760
Sorry for the wait!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.800
Charge!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.300
Don't...

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:11.060
Go, go for it!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.310
Senny.

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:17.730
Here.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.190
I don't see any meat.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:24.150
Stir-fried veggies with no meat,
what were you thinking, idiot?

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:27.490
But you only said stir-fried vegetables...

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.870
Throw it away, then.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:29.740
I want cake.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.750
Here's your cake.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.790
Why is there no cheesecake in here?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:42.170
You have to request what you want...

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.220
Well then... pudding!

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:44.970
Here.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.340
Herring soba!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.300
Here you go.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.470
Glutinous rice!

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.510
Here.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.140
Mandrake root!

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.470
From where?!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:56.900
I'm back...

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:59.860
You're slow, Alesta.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.490
Plug! I've had about enough of your...

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:12.290
Hurry up! The online auction is about to start!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.120
The legendary robot finally appears!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.710
Super-Real Alloy!

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.290
The latest item, Rare Gunner!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.250
Pre-orders start now.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.420
What is that?

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.340
The site still uses vein recognition, incredibly.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.590
Just look at these, I can't even process the order.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:32.720
And you want me to get it for you?! It's 80,000 yen!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.180
I'll pay you back.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.480
<i>The look on her face tells me otherwise!</i>

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:42.900
It's done.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.400
Now, help me clean myself.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.740
Isn't that supposed to be a nurse's job?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.450
I want it to be you, Alesta.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:55.750
Manga: My Dear Sister

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.040
Sis...

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.830
You're so cute, my kitten...

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.880
Sis, it feels good...

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.050
I'll make you feel even better.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.100
Sis, I'm so embarrassed.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.930
There's no need to be afraid.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.600
Sis... you're beautiful...

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.240
Don't tell me you're into that stuff?!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.620
<i>Is she being serious?</i>

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:37.500
You did it! Nice work, Iono!

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:38.830
You think so?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.250
Definitely.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:43.330
Omelets, egg rolls, and miso soup.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:45.250
It was a wonderful egg feast!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.960
Did I overdo it?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:50.720
I don't think so; brother did ask for seconds, didn't he?

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.930
He definitely liked it!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.100
I'm glad.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.180
Yup, yup!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.890
<i>Maybe I'll try making him a boxed lunch.</i>

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.730
We bring you live to the scene.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.860
I really overate this time... didn't I?

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.190
This is the scene of the incident.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:09.860
Based on the statements of friends and family, he had no motive for suicide.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.860
Office Burned Down                   Attempted Suicide?

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.820
Police are considering it a possible accident or arson...

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:25.170
I never thought you'd make me do something this trivial.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.250
It's a good experience!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.800
How?

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.760
Okay, your back is done.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.970
It's better if you lie down for me to clean the front.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.680
That's right.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:47.860
What?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.320
Nothing.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.700
It's just that seeing an already small chest get smaller...

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.950
Shut up!

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:59.910
You should just use the washing spray. It's much faster, and it's cleaner.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:04.670
I prefer this kind of thing done manually.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.670
I really don't get you. So whimsical.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:12.380
You'll soon come to understand, Alesta.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.050
I'll pass.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:21.140
You're getting sweaty already?

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.930
I just wiped you dry not long ago.

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.940
It feels like it's getting warm.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.190
Does it?

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.110
I'm thirsty.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.400
You want me to get you water?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.110
Or do you want something from the store?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.450
Then, get me some water, please.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.030
I'll take French Evian.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.330
Don't kid with me!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.290
I'm not kidding at all.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.080
Well, anything will do, I suppose.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.840
I'll go, damn it!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.670
Good luck!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.110
Yes, what's the problem?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:15.860
I'm sorry... can I have painkillers... please...

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:53.110
It's a maid.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.120
You're a lively one!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.000
I guess we didn't need to stop by.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.250
I can't believe you got such a good room.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.920
All of this is too luxurious for plain 'ol Plug.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:15.210
If you don't stop being such a moron, you'll get killed next time.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:21.050
Well, Taako, if you're my friend then why not use a vacation day to visit me?

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:26.350
That day of vacation will go to waste if it's just to visit you, Plug.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.190
We specifically came after work, you know.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.810
You should be treating us to drinks.

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:35.860
Did you guys just come here to bully the sick?!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.110
Correct!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:40.110
It's Alesta. Came to visit too, I see...

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.780
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.580
Look at that, it's so cute!

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:51.210
That's called a maid outfit, right?
It's my first time seeing one!

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:54.590
You know what this outfit is?

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:57.760
No, I've only heard about it from Plug.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:01.760
But Alesta, this is a vacation day for you, right?

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.680
Yeah.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.720
You were here since morning?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:05.810
I suppose so.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:10.020
It's partner-love! Partner-love!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.860
Yes, partner-love!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.610
Love is in the air!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.990
<i>They're the same.</i>

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:23.490
<i>The ones in Second Division are just like Plug.</i>

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.580
Oh Plug, you lucky dog!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.040
I'm jealous!

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.490
Stop it!

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:32.420
I think I'd like saying "Master!"

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:35.420
Me too! I want to be a maid, too!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.130
But not Plug, of course.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.920
Duh!

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.880
Oh, really?

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.970
You were the one who made Alesta wear that?

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.390
<i>That's not it.</i>

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:51.430
<i>It's just that I never really knew...</i>

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.940
<i>...what the people in Second Division were like.</i>

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:59.070
<i>And at the center of it is...</i>

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.320
<i>That's why...</i>

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:11.040
Well, they say stupid kids are cute. I don't think so, though.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:16.170
But you know, Alesta, it was a surprise you partnered up with her...

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:21.510
She's an idiot, and her personality isn't that good either. It must be hard on you.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:25.220
I had no clue what I was getting into, so it's been rough.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:28.810
I guess you'll be careful next time, then.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.350
Careful?

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:34.020
We saw the video, the one where you're crying.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.190
Didn't you know?

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:37.860
Yeah, we saw it!

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:39.730
You were really bawling!

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:41.990
Crying like a cute baby!

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:43.860
Hold on.

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:51.790
Why do they all know about that...?

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:56.960
Wait a sec!

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:00.250
Mistress Plug!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:04.970
I managed to videotape Mistress Alesta's maidscapades.

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:20.480
Plug...!

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:29.240
I'm sorry!

00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:39.670
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:39.670
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.500
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.500
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:45.260
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:45.260
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.010
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.010
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:53.510
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:53.510
I decided that I would live strong

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:55.270
Kimi to deau made wa

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:55.270
Until the day I could meet you

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:03.270
Sore wa arigachi na

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:03.270
"That really is

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:06.070
Warui kuse da yo

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:06.070
It's a bad habit

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.860
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.860
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:11.660
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:11.660
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:16.790
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:16.790
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.960
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.960
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:21.670
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:21.670
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:25.510
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:25.510
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:33.510
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:29.590
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:33.510
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:39.100
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:36.430
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.100
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:45.360
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:45.360
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:50.110
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:50.110
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:54.620
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:54.620
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:55.950
Itsumademo

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:55.950
Now and forever

00:23:56.330 --> 00:24:00.160
Eien Sweetheart

00:23:56.330 --> 00:24:00.160
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:09.470
Sorry for the wait, everyone! Plug Cryostat has arrived!

00:24:09.470 --> 00:24:14.050
I think we've all learned a valuable lesson about other people's kindness. Thank you, Alesta.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:18.180
Is that all you have to say, you stalking bitch?!

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:20.810
Alesta's rage meter has maxed out!

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:23.480
How will things unfold next?!

00:24:23.480 --> 00:24:25.520
On the next episode of
Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:24:24.940 --> 00:24:33.910
Messing around and Kindness!

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:26.690
Messing around and kindness!

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:30.570
Sentou actually did so much for my sake...?

00:24:30.570 --> 00:24:33.910
What?! Damn you, Plug!
